  <article class="cv-entry rounded-lg px-3 py-4">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-medium text-ink">Bachelor of Laws (LL.B) — Final Year, 500L</h3>
